Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.46,0:00:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs65\shad0\bord0\c&H6356AC&\pos(960,637.2)}爪爪字幕組
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.68,0:01:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,早安 夜之城 一同迎接夢想之城嶄新的一天
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.57,0:01:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,今天上班又要遲到了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.61,0:01:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,有人還在做白日夢 想當下一個「老蛇」韋蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.45,0:01:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,害所有人塞車堵得動彈不得
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.16,0:02:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,老天 這個城市怎麼搞的 一直吸引的是…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.10,0:02:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,永遠不要害怕冒險
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.98,0:02:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,目標不遠大 永遠沒結果
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.30,0:02:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,想知道夜之城的傳奇人物都在哪玩
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.39,0:02:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,答案就在…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.52,0:02:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,曼恩
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.14,0:02:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你還沒吃飯吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.11,0:02:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你的手臂在發抖
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.02,0:02:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,義體在侵蝕你的神經 對嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.41,0:02:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,等這單做完 你得換輕一點的義體了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.37,0:02:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,打個冷顫而已 沒事的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.75,0:02:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,按照這個速度…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.42,0:02:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,就這麼點植入體不會…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.34,0:02:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,曼恩
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.46,0:02:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,曼恩
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.05,0:02:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,閉嘴 沒人比我更了解自己的身體
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.86,0:03:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我幹這行 這麼久都堅持下來了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.64,0:03:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,絕不可能中途放棄
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.35,0:03:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,數據怎麼還沒好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.52,0:03:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你明知道琦薇在拚命潛入搜索了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.19,0:03:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,這裡的入侵對抗電元比我想的還堅固
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.42,0:03:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,曼恩 住手 你在搞什…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.46,0:03:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.20,0:03:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,琦薇 法爾科
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.75,0:03:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.39,0:03:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,冷靜下來了嗎 混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.93,0:03:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,多莉歐
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.31,0:03:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,剛才怎麼了 我們被攻擊嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.77,0:03:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,,琦薇怎麼變這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.90,0:03:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,預計海岸區域會有強降雨
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.20,0:03:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,聖多明戈以及威斯特布魯克
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.78,0:04:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,從午夜到清晨時分有小雨
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.69,0:04:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\bord0\fs45\c&H2425A5&\frz358.4\pos(318,152)\frx358\fry4}法爾科
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.21,0:04:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,搞什麼 法爾科
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.75,0:04:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,問曼恩 你就跟我說…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.80,0:04:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.21,0:04:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.60,0:04:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我不行的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.14,0:04:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,琦薇怎會忽然送去急救
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.81,0:04:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,她本來在潛入調查田中的案子吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.94,0:04:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.48,0:04:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,這得問我旁邊的這個混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.23,0:04:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,閉嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.58,0:04:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,當時她正被對方的ICE困住
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.37,0:04:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,曼恩卻大發火 把她打了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.91,0:04:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.49,0:04:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,曼恩 你要不要去檢查
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.37,0:04:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,曼恩 下次你發現失控症狀的時候…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.50,0:04:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼意思
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.63,0:04:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼的症狀
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.63,0:04:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,賽博精神錯亂
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.64,0:05:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,曼恩
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.60,0:05:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.39,0:05:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我聽多莉歐說了 你…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.02,0:05:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,會沒事吧 不會像…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.61,0:05:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.51,0:05:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,「沒事」是什麼意思 大衛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.86,0:05:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你在問我會不會變成賽博瘋子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.91,0:05:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你覺得我會那樣終結嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.28,0:05:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,曼恩 我不是那個意思
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.16,0:05:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,離我遠點 大衛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.37,0:05:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你四處窺探已經讓我反感
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.04,0:05:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,斯安威斯坦讓你穿梭自如
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.20,0:05:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,就自以為了不起
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.55,0:05:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,那原本該是我的 你給我記住
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.37,0:05:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我一路走到了這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.92,0:05:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,現在不可能給義體降級
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.11,0:05:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我努力走這麼遠 是為了什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.65,0:06:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,那些蠢豬可能已經快要追上了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.45,0:06:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我們的時間只有到明早 你也知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.95,0:06:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我們別無選擇
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.08,0:06:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我說不
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.68,0:06:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你才是 到底懂不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.24,0:06:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,他是荒坂的…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.42,0:06:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我們放棄吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.69,0:06:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,回家吧 露西
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.55,0:06:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,不要勉強自己
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.21,0:06:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,閉嘴 大衛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.63,0:06:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,可以把田中丟回原本的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.04,0:06:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,假裝這一切都沒發生
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.39,0:06:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你說夠了沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.81,0:06:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你不可能永遠逃避
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.76,0:06:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,大衛 告訴我 我辦得到
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.14,0:06:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼 我以為剛才…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.85,0:06:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,告訴我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.06,0:06:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,荒坂是什麼樣子 你根本毫無概念
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.57,0:06:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,他們無時不刻都在監視著你我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.03,0:06:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我們不能放棄
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.41,0:06:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,別無選擇了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.45,0:06:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我很清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.20,0:06:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,但是…如果由你來告訴我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.46,0:06:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我一定…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.71,0:07:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,對不起 露西 我…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.13,0:07:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道 你可以的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.30,0:07:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,放手去做吧 露西
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.51,0:07:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我來
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.98,0:07:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.64,0:07:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,條件是大衛跟我一起 曼恩不要介入
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.77,0:07:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不答應我 我就不去
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.03,0:07:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.32,0:07:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,但是要保持聯繫 15分鐘更新一次
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.53,0:07:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,時限是黎明前 知道了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.20,0:07:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,大衛 曼恩人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.98,0:07:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.91,0:07:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\bord0\fs45\c&H2425A5&\frz358.4\pos(318,152)\frx358\fry4}多莉歐
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.89,0:07:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,曼恩
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.55,0:07:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,多莉歐
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.60,0:07:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你確定我們不需要多莉歐幫忙
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.69,0:08:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,有點骨氣
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.27,0:08:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你剛才為什麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.27,0:08:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你應該先跟我說好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.86,0:08:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼只有我們兩個
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.24,0:08:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,大衛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.95,0:08:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.13,0:08:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你為什麼要隱藏深潛介面
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.13,0:08:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,準備接入
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.18,0:08:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,大衛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.81,0:08:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.06,0:08:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我要潛入了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.02,0:08:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,有陷阱的地方就有通道
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.41,0:09:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,曼恩怎麼樣了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.17,0:09:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,冷靜下來了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.59,0:09:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,多莉歐 這傢伙…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.59,0:09:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.51,0:09:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,沒事 當我沒說
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.94,0:09:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我們要殺他嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.93,0:09:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,萬一來不及 我們要做好準備
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.37,0:09:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,要是你狀態好一點 我們就不需要了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.40,0:09:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\bord0\fs45\c&H2425A5&\frz358.4\pos(318,152)\frx358\fry4}法拉第
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.90,0:09:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,又有什麼事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.24,0:09:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,數據拿到了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.82,0:09:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,正在進行
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.50,0:09:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,有點久啊 誰在裡面
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.79,0:09:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你想怎樣
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.74,0:09:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,曼恩 你在隱瞞什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.78,0:09:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.03,0:09:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,沒有琦薇 辦得到嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.43,0:09:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎麼…可惡 法爾科
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.30,0:09:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,這活 對候補駭客會不會太難了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.51,0:09:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,沒問題
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.93,0:09:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,總之 動作快點
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.34,0:09:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我們現在挾持了荒坂高層人士的肉身
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.79,0:09:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,只能成功 不能失敗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.85,0:10:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.77,0:10:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.90,0:10:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,法拉第 你看什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.74,0:10:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,這麼不穩定…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.03,0:10:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,可惡 偏選在這個時候
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.12,0:10:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.54,0:10:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下 求求你
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.63,0:10:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,大衛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.76,0:10:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,曼恩 振作一點
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.21,0:10:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.94,0:10:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,可惡 麻醉效果要過了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.10,0:10:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你在幹什麼 大衛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.31,0:10:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我就知道…你是大衛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.52,0:10:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你為什麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.69,0:10:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,聽說好多關於你的事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.99,0:11:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,包括和我兒子在學院的事故
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.10,0:11:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,即使如此 是我下令讓你回到學院
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.37,0:11:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,是你
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.67,0:11:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,大衛 求求你 幫幫我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.92,0:11:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想死
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.67,0:11:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我們只要數據 你不會…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.93,0:11:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,別再天真了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.14,0:11:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我看過他們的臉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.93,0:11:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你認為荒坂不會趕盡殺絕嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.52,0:11:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,聽著 你知道我為何撤銷退學令
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.27,0:11:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你有卓越的能力
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.48,0:11:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我相信你能成為荒坂的優秀人才
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.28,0:11:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我們能給你光明的前途 大衛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.95,0:11:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,不要浪費你的人生
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.84,0:11:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,就是這個
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.59,0:12:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs90\fax0.15\frz6.445\pos(526,764)\frx4\fry358}{\c&H391FEE&\bord0}下載
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.23,0:12:08.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能放你走
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.70,0:12:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,那就快聯繫荒坂公司
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.65,0:12:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,其他什麼也不用做 一切會在五分鐘內結束
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.28,0:12:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是那個意思
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.99,0:12:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能背叛我的團隊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.36,0:12:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,愚蠢的小孩
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.84,0:12:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,再這樣下去 你就會被利用至死
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.37,0:12:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,加入荒坂 我一樣會被利用
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.87,0:12:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,不 你還不明白嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.50,0:12:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,很顯然軍用科技在幕後資助
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.75,0:12:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你不過只是換家公司打工
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.63,0:12:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,這個世界 無論你多努力 爬到多高
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.46,0:12:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,連最低等的公司 你都比不上
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.92,0:12:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼會…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.88,0:13:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,大衛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.53,0:13:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\bord0\fs45\c&H2425A5&\frx2\fry342\pos(1746,136)\frz2.551}多莉歐
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.26,0:13:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\bord0\fs45\c&H2425A5&\frz358.4\pos(318,152)\frx358\fry4}多莉歐
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.96,0:13:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,大衛…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.83,0:13:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你心底真正想要的是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.50,0:13:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我想要什麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.75,0:13:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,大衛 搞什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.45,0:13:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,他醒了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.64,0:13:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,鎮定劑呢 快給我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.80,0:13:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,可惡 剛才怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.30,0:13:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,糟了 他要是死掉就完了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.34,0:13:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,大衛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.36,0:13:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,振作一點 大衛 是你幫她接入的 對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.23,0:13:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我該怎麼做
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.94,0:13:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,多莉歐 露西還困在深潛中
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.47,0:13:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.18,0:13:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,快點斷開她的連接
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.07,0:13:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 拔掉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.47,0:13:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,數據沒問題吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.67,0:14:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你在他心跳結束前一刻打入鎮定劑 所以可能…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.59,0:14:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,大衛
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.05,0:14:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,露西應該也沒…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.64,0:14:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,大衛 你在搞什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.35,0:14:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,那你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.32,0:14:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你才在搞什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.77,0:14:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.94,0:14:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,打昏琦薇 害露西要自己來
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.82,0:14:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你到底在幹什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.15,0:14:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,大衛 你…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.95,0:14:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,曼恩 大衛
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.03,0:14:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,田中死時 干擾器爆掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.20,0:14:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,信號已經發送給創傷小組了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.06,0:14:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.61,0:14:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,大衛 有話回頭再說
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.84,0:14:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,去把車準備好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.05,0:14:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,振作一點 大衛
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.06,0:14:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你答應要幹這票的 那好好做
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.72,0:14:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我們馬上趕上 在車上等著
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.80,0:14:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.31,0:14:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,原來這就是白金會員服務
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.70,0:14:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,多莉歐
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.36,0:15:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,服務區內有槍聲記錄
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.49,0:15:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,或有武裝人員出沒
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.54,0:15:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,尋求NCPD武力支援
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.38,0:15:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,大衛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.00,0:15:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,,露西 你還好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.26,0:15:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.51,0:15:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,田中醒來 但他的大腦突然爆裂
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.76,0:15:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,裡面出了什麼事嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.85,0:15:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,曼恩和多莉歐呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.68,0:15:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,他們要帶田中的屍體出來
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.35,0:15:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,可是他不是死了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.78,0:15:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我們救了他
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.56,0:15:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.73,0:15:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼意思 我們還需要數據
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.19,0:15:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,帶著他 沒有任何意義
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.20,0:15:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,數據根本不存在
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.70,0:15:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,不會吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.79,0:15:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,可惡 荒坂現在一定已得到消息
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.87,0:15:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,曼恩 不要忘記帶藥
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.42,0:16:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我才剛打了一劑
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.92,0:16:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,站住
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.68,0:16:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,可惡 為什麼這種時候 警察動作那麼快
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.92,0:16:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,後退
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.60,0:16:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,可惡 他們不接電話
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.39,0:16:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,大衛
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.48,0:16:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你要去哪裡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.48,0:16:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,去幫忙
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.40,0:16:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,傻子 萬一他們從別的出口逃走呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.48,0:16:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,在這裡等
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.66,0:16:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我一定要去
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.71,0:16:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,大衛
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.71,0:16:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你怕什麼 他們這麼久還不出來 怕有蹊蹺
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.17,0:16:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.54,0:16:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我收到信號 創傷小組和NCPD都到了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.67,0:16:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,他們被包圍了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.09,0:16:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,那我們更要幫忙
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.18,0:16:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 你想找死嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.64,0:17:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我不會死 特別是你還在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.31,0:17:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,大衛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.69,0:17:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,他們可能出不來 我們應該伺機逃命
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.15,0:17:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我聽得見打鬥聲 他們還活著
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.91,0:17:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你今天有點反常 露西
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.58,0:17:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你在田中的腦袋看到了什麼 對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.62,0:17:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是不想你…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.04,0:17:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,露西
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.59,0:17:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,那句話 我想你應該也不會對我說吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.38,0:17:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,那句「你可以的」
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.28,0:17:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,搞什麼 曼恩
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.78,0:17:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,振作起來
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.54,0:18:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,可惡 混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.58,0:18:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,不要開槍
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.42,0:18:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.81,0:18:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,那個人質是白金客戶
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.38,0:18:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,不是我們的問題
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.79,0:18:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,多莉歐
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.38,0:18:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,曼恩 我來了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.72,0:18:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.42,0:18:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要聽到你說 我辦得到
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.35,0:19:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,這一切…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.18,0:19:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,都是我的錯嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.78,0:19:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,別動 放下武器 雙手高舉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.24,0:19:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你聽到了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.71,0:19:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,白金會員客戶 確認死亡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.09,0:19:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.21,0:19:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,這是我的錯嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.13,0:19:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,是賽博瘋子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.22,0:19:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,緊急召喚暴恐機動隊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.97,0:19:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,有賽博精神病…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.22,0:19:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,客戶已死亡 全體撤退
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.52,0:19:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你要去哪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.10,0:19:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,客戶條款已失效 接下來是你們的事了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.65,0:19:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,開什麼玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.32,0:19:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,他來了 帶我們離開
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.37,0:20:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fax0.04\pos(546,428)\frx350\fry22\frz6.637}{\fs35\bord0\c&H37FEFD&}大堂
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.25,0:20:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.22,0:20:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,大衛 你聽得見嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.57,0:20:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,曼恩變成了賽博瘋子
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.69,0:20:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,暴恐機動隊要到了 你快回來
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.77,0:20:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,曼恩…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.07,0:20:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,是你啊 大衛
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.66,0:20:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你沒受傷吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.20,0:20:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,曼恩 我回來幫你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.20,0:20:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,呃…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.12,0:20:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,多莉歐死了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.70,0:20:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.64,0:20:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你在做什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.87,0:20:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我只能為她做這點事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.09,0:20:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我們快撤吧 曼恩
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.76,0:20:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你會死的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.93,0:21:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想再逃跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.73,0:21:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,死神已經降臨
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.06,0:21:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你在說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.23,0:21:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fs100\bord0\c&H555612&\move(1210,324,732,324,0,1962)}暴恐機動隊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.27,0:21:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道了 我和你一起戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.94,0:21:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,大衛…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.60,0:21:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我已經決定了 一定要來
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.75,0:21:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我要來救你出去 曼恩
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.28,0:21:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,可惡 不要一直發抖
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.10,0:21:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,去你的 暴恐機動隊 放馬過來啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.01,0:21:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,曼恩 我們二人並肩 一定可以的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.58,0:21:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我們一定能堅持過去 然後…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.58,0:21:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs90\fax0.15\frx52\fry358\frz25.21\pos(500,832)}{\c&H391FEE&\bord0}注意 請勿靠近
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.48,0:21:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,大衛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.86,0:22:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你現在還辦不到
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.87,0:22:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼 曼恩…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.95,0:22:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.55,0:22:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,大衛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.93,0:22:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,這就是我的終點了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.93,0:22:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,但你要活下去
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.04,0:22:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是比誰都跑得快嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.69,0:22:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,現在 跑起來吧
Comment: 0,0:22:12.12,0:22:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:16.03,0:00:21.42,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}Eyes burning a way through me
Dialogue: 1,0:00:22.61,0:00:27.77,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}Eyes destroying so sweetly
Dialogue: 1,0:00:29.00,0:00:34.32,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}Now there is a fire in me
Dialogue: 1,0:00:34.73,0:00:42.50,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}A fire that burns
Dialogue: 1,0:01:08.85,0:01:11.56,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}This fire is out of control
Dialogue: 1,0:01:11.56,0:01:12.36,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}I'll burn it
Dialogue: 1,0:01:12.36,0:01:13.21,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}I'll burn it
Dialogue: 1,0:01:13.21,0:01:14.03,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}I'll burn it
Dialogue: 1,0:01:14.03,0:01:15.42,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}I'll burn it down
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.69,0:01:25.49,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}I'll burn it
Dialogue: 1,0:01:25.49,0:01:26.34,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}I'll burn it
Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.34,0:01:27.16,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}I'll burn it
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.16,0:01:28.55,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}I'll burn it down
Comment: 0,0:01:29.16,0:01:31.16,op-english,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.03,0:00:21.42,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}世人的眼光中我烈焰焚身
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.61,0:00:27.77,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}眼神中期盼著甜蜜殺戮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.00,0:00:34.32,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}現在我的心中燃起了一簇烈火
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.73,0:00:42.50,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}以我殘軀化烈火
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.85,0:01:11.56,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}這簇失控的火焰啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.56,0:01:12.36,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}讓我把這座城市燒成灰
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.36,0:01:13.21,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}燒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.21,0:01:14.03,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}燒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.03,0:01:15.42,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}燒成灰
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.69,0:01:25.49,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}讓我把這座城市燒成灰
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.49,0:01:26.34,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}燒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.34,0:01:27.16,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}燒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.16,0:01:28.55,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}燒成灰
