Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.30,0:24:24.62,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}They will finally feel the flames
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.62,0:24:29.05,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}Flames that run down through my veins
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.05,0:24:33.39,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}I will make the city burn
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.39,0:24:37.75,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}We're not planning to return
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.51,0:24:42.15,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}Trying so hard to be free
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.57,0:24:45.97,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}To make you see what I see
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.34,0:24:50.88,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}Hold on to your wishes
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.88,0:24:54.70,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}If you can't hold on to me
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.90,0:24:58.50,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}Forgive me for letting you down
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.39,0:25:03.75,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}Forgive me for letting you down again
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.75,0:25:06.95,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}I guess I'm not strong enough
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.57,0:25:10.79,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}Right now
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.61,0:25:18.15,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}Oh my love
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.15,0:25:22.48,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}love
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.48,0:25:29.77,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}love
Comment: 0,0:25:30.33,0:25:32.33,op-english,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.30,0:24:24.62,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}他們終究會擦出愛情之火
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.62,0:24:29.05,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}火化為血液 在我體內流淌
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.05,0:24:33.39,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}我會引燃這座都市
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.39,0:24:37.75,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}我們從未有撤退的打算
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.51,0:24:42.15,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}努力去獲得自由
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.57,0:24:45.97,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}只為讓你見我所見
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.34,0:24:50.88,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}牢牢抓住你的期盼
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.88,0:24:54.70,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}如果你無法再握住我的手
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.90,0:24:58.50,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}請原諒我 讓你失望了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.39,0:25:03.75,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}請原諒我 又一次
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.75,0:25:06.95,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}我想還未擁有守護你的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.57,0:25:10.79,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}只為此時
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.61,0:25:18.15,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}哦 我的摯愛
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.15,0:25:22.48,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}我們永恆的愛
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.48,0:25:29.77,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}你我永不分離
Comment: 0,0:22:07.83,0:22:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,
